{"id":"642328","name":"马蹄爽","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/642328/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"马蹄","amount":"适量"},{"name":"马蹄粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"冰糖","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备:新鲜马蹄，马蹄粉，黄冰糖。","img":"images/642328/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将马蹄削皮清洗干净。","img":"images/642328/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切碎。","img":"images/642328/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"小煮锅里水烧开放入马蹄碎。","img":"images/642328/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"适量马蹄粉放入碗里加水调好，浓稠度以各人喜爱。","img":"images/642328/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"马蹄碎煮开后约一两分钟，马蹄很易熟的。","img":"images/642328/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入冰糖煮至溶化，表面的浮沫需撇掉。","img":"images/642328/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"冰糖溶化后。","img":"images/642328/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将调好的生马蹄浆倒入锅。","img":"images/642328/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"用勺子不停的搅拌。","img":"images/642328/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"再次煮沸即可。","img":"images/642328/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/642328/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/642328/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}